    "name": "Journey's Spirit",
    "steam_appid": 3592760,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/157123b619cba147a51f55338900311a.poster.avif?t=1749403941\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/157123b619cba147a51f55338900311a.webm?t=1749403941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/157123b619cba147a51f55338900311a.mp4?t=1749403941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Journey's Spirit is an action RPG epic adventure. Use the elements of nature during combat. Adapt your equipment along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a fantasy kingdom seized by demonic forces, the hero must reclaim his honor by saving his comrades from the hands of the Darkest Warlock by crushing him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/1e0dfa57af3b3d966c436c01435248c7.poster.avif?t=1749403941\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/1e0dfa57af3b3d966c436c01435248c7.webm?t=1749403941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/1e0dfa57af3b3d966c436c01435248c7.mp4?t=1749403941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                        \u2013 <strong>Exploration!</strong> Combat enemies, defeat bosses, and complete quests, while discovering new materials, consumables, and armor in the meantime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 <strong>Elements!</strong> Elemental powers impose various statuses. Adapting tactics won't get you bored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 <strong>Reactions!</strong> Combinations of elements lead to various effects like chain lightning or explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 <strong>Skills!</strong> Armor gives skills that influence the approach to combat and the usage of elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 <strong>Items!</strong> Craft consumables from gathered materials and use them to apply elements or for other effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/0afac608af537793ea8644c99ee58012.poster.avif?t=1749403941\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/0afac608af537793ea8644c99ee58012.webm?t=1749403941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/0afac608af537793ea8644c99ee58012.mp4?t=1749403941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is developed by one person \u2013 Aleksei Chistov, a self-taught programmer who brings Journey's Spirit to life without the use of game engines.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/157123b619cba147a51f55338900311a.poster.avif?t=1749403941\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/157123b619cba147a51f55338900311a.webm?t=1749403941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/157123b619cba147a51f55338900311a.mp4?t=1749403941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Journey's Spirit is an action RPG epic adventure. Use the elements of nature during combat. Adapt your equipment along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a fantasy kingdom seized by demonic forces, the hero must reclaim his honor by saving his comrades from the hands of the Darkest Warlock by crushing him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/1e0dfa57af3b3d966c436c01435248c7.poster.avif?t=1749403941\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/1e0dfa57af3b3d966c436c01435248c7.webm?t=1749403941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/1e0dfa57af3b3d966c436c01435248c7.mp4?t=1749403941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                        \u2013 <strong>Exploration!</strong> Combat enemies, defeat bosses, and complete quests, while discovering new materials, consumables, and armor in the meantime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 <strong>Elements!</strong> Elemental powers impose various statuses. Adapting tactics won't get you bored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 <strong>Reactions!</strong> Combinations of elements lead to various effects like chain lightning or explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 <strong>Skills!</strong> Armor gives skills that influence the approach to combat and the usage of elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 <strong>Items!</strong> Craft consumables from gathered materials and use them to apply elements or for other effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/0afac608af537793ea8644c99ee58012.poster.avif?t=1749403941\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/0afac608af537793ea8644c99ee58012.webm?t=1749403941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/extras/0afac608af537793ea8644c99ee58012.mp4?t=1749403941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is developed by one person \u2013 Aleksei Chistov, a self-taught programmer who brings Journey's Spirit to life without the use of game engines.</p>",
